            <div class="eyebrow">Jay Shree Radha Govinda</div>
            <h1 data-en="Promoting Sanatani culture and heritage statewide, and advancing social welfare for the community." data-bn="রাজ্য জুড়ে সনাতনী সংস্কৃতি ও ঐতিহ্য প্রচার এবং সমাজের কল্যাণে অগ্রগতি।">Promoting <em>Sanatani</em> culture and heritage statewide, and advancing social welfare for the community.</h1>
            <p class="lede">Kamalarani Foundation is dedicated to preserving, propagating, and celebrating timeless Sanatani culture, heritage, and values across West Bengal.</p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a href="#about" class="btn btn-primary" aria-label="Learn about our Sanatani mission">Our Mission</a>
              <a href="#support" class="btn btn-ghost" aria-label="Donate to support our work">Donate</a>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-stats">
              <div class="stat"><b>2</b><span>Active Centres</span></div>
              <div class="stat"><b>100%</b><span>Free of Cost</span></div>
              <div class="stat"><b>15+</b><span>Volunteers &amp; Team</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-visual" style="background: #FAF1CD;">
            <img src="/images/temple.jpeg" alt="Sri Sri Radha-Govinda Thakurbari Temple, Natabari — Kamalarani Foundation" width="600" height="750" loading="eager" style="object-fit: cover; width: 100%; height: 100%;">
            <div class="hero-badge">Sri Sri Radha-Govinda Thakurbari — Natabari</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Slide 2: Promoting Free Art & Music Classes -->
      <div class="hero-slide" data-slide="1">
        <div class="hero-grid">
          <div>
            <div class="eyebrow">Free Art &amp; Music Education · West Bengal</div>
            <h1 data-en="Empowering village children with free Art & Music classes." data-bn="গ্রামের শিশুদের বিনামূল্যে শিল্প ও সঙ্গীত শিক্ষায় ক্ষমতায়ন।">Empowering village children with free <em>Art &amp; Music</em> classes.</h1>
            <p class="lede">Providing free drawing books, colors, music mentorship, and learning supplies for children in rural West Bengal — because every child deserves a chance to learn and grow.</p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a href="#admission" class="btn btn-primary" aria-label="Enroll a child in free art classes">Enroll a Child</a>
              <a href="#support" class="btn btn-ghost" aria-label="Support free education for children">Donate</a>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-stats">
              <div class="stat"><b>100%</b><span>Free Materials</span></div>
              <div class="stat"><b>Graduation</b><span>Nursery to Graduation</span></div>
              <div class="stat"><b>Weekly</b><span>Art &amp; Music Sessions</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-visual" style="background: #FAF1CD;">
            <img src="/images/children_drawings_temple.jpg" alt="Village children displaying artwork at Kamalarani Foundation art class" width="600" height="750" loading="eager" style="object-fit: cover; width: 100%; height: 100%;">
            <div class="hero-badge">Free Art Classes — Sri Sri Radha-Govinda Thakurbari</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Navigation Arrows -->
    <button class="slider-arrow prev-arrow" id="heroPrevBtn" aria-label="Previous slide">‹</button>
    <button class="slider-arrow next-arrow" id="heroNextBtn" aria-label="Next slide">›</button>

    <!-- Slide Indicators -->
    <div class="slider-dots" id="heroDots">
      <button class="dot active" data-goto="0" aria-label="Slide 1: Promoting Sanatani Culture"></button>
      <button class="dot" data-goto="1" aria-label="Slide 2: Free Art &amp; Music Classes"></button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="wrap about-grid">
    <div class="about-img">
      <img src="/images/temple.jpeg" alt="Sri Sri Radha-Govinda Thakurbari, Natabari — venue for Kamalarani Foundation art classes" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <h2 id="about-heading">Our Mission</h2>
      <p>Kamalarani Foundation was founded to support the creative development, education, and future of children in rural West Bengal. We believe a child's circumstances should never limit their access to learning.</p>
      <div class="quote-block">"To bring the light of education, creativity, and a beautiful future into every child's hands."</div>
      <p><strong>Our Agenda:</strong> To promote and propagate Sanatani culture and values across the state, and to work towards the social welfare and upliftment of the community.</p>
      <p>Our free art classes began at the Sri Sri Radha-Govinda Thakurbari in Natabari, Coochbehar, and we're steadily expanding into further skill-development and educational programmes for children, step by step.</p>
      <span class="reg-tag">Registration No. AAETK689KE20221</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

